    "answer": {
      "short": "$m=-\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "worked": "Factorise the right-hand side:\n$$\\begin{align*}-\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{15}{2}&=-\\frac{5}{2}(x+3)\\end{align*}$$\nComparing the factors multiplying $x+3$ gives\n$$\\begin{align*}m-2&=-\\frac{5}{2}\\\\m&=2-\\frac{5}{2}\\\\m&=-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
